# Network Integration and Nextcloud Connectivity

## Overview

After completing the standalone deployment of the Nextcloud server, the next phase of the project focused on integrating the application into the shared project network. The objective was to establish secure communication between the office workstation and the Nextcloud server through the pfSense firewall while maintaining proper network segmentation.

This integration provides the foundation for communication between the project components, including Nextcloud, Wazuh and MinIO.

---

# Objectives

The objectives of this implementation were to:

- Integrate the Nextcloud server into the project network.
- Configure a dedicated integration VLAN.
- Enable secure communication through pfSense.
- Verify HTTPS connectivity from the office workstation.
- Prepare the environment for Wazuh monitoring integration.
- Prepare the environment for MinIO backup integration.

---

# Network Architecture

The Nextcloud virtual machine was configured with two network interfaces.

| Interface | IP Address | Purpose |
|-----------|------------|---------|
| NAT Network | 172.16.229.150 | Internet connectivity, package installation and system updates |
| VLAN 20 | 10.20.20.10 | Internal communication with project components through pfSense |

The NAT interface allows Internet access for software updates and package installation, while VLAN 20 is dedicated to secure communication between project servers.

---

# Why VLAN 20?

A dedicated VLAN 20 was created to separate the project integration network from the Internet-facing NAT network.

Using a dedicated VLAN provides several advantages:

- Isolates project traffic from external network traffic.
- Improves network security through segmentation.
- Reduces unnecessary broadcast traffic.
- Allows pfSense firewall rules to control communication between servers.
- Provides a scalable architecture for future project expansion.

This design follows common enterprise networking practices where servers are isolated according to their roles.

