# Integration Process

The following implementation tasks were completed:

1. Added a second network adapter to the Nextcloud virtual machine.
2. Connected the adapter to the pfSense integration network.
3. Assigned a static IP address on VLAN 20.
4. Verified connectivity between the office workstation and the Nextcloud server.
5. Configured routing through pfSense.
6. Verified Apache web services.
7. Tested HTTP and HTTPS connectivity.
8. Confirmed browser access from the office workstation.

