# Lessons Learned

This implementation demonstrated that successful network integration requires verification beyond basic connectivity tests. Although ICMP and TCP connectivity were functioning correctly, application-layer communication was still affected by an MTU mismatch. Systematic troubleshooting and validation of network parameters were essential to identifying the root cause and restoring secure HTTPS communication.
